    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to be silly? Be goofy? Find happiness after losing your entire family? Well look no further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Silly Goofy Dream 2 is a game set in your dreams, in which you can go around finding funny characters and seeing what interesting things they have to do or say! Each character is completely unique (in some ways), and all are made to make you laugh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different levels to explore and places to go, though for some reason it seems the further you go the more you're grip on reality slowly goes away...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can run around, jump around, interact with NPC's, punch NPCs, and just do stupid things in a few different worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What will keep you going? What will make you last? Will these dreams truly stop the never-ending torment?</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to be silly? Be goofy? Find happiness after losing your entire family? Well look no further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Silly Goofy Dream 2 is a game set in your dreams, in which you can go around finding funny characters and seeing what interesting things they have to do or say! Each character is completely unique (in some ways), and all are made to make you laugh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different levels to explore and places to go, though for some reason it seems the further you go the more you're grip on reality slowly goes away...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can run around, jump around, interact with NPC's, punch NPCs, and just do stupid things in a few different worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What will keep you going? What will make you last? Will these dreams truly stop the never-ending torment?</i></p>",
    "short_description": "This game is funny, it is not meant to be taken seriously. ASGD2 is a funny linear story game in which you go around finding funny NPC's, interacting with them, and completing levels to try an unlock a complete story.",
